/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-1-// reference/src/semantics/operators.k — MPY-OPERATORS
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-2-// The operator DISPATCH layer: operands evaluate by strictness (heat/cool over KResult=Val),
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k:3:// the cooled node hands to applyUn/applyBin/applyCmp (declared in core.k; each domain file
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-4-// owns its cases — bool.k, int.k, float.k, str.k, list.k, tuple.k, set.k, dict.k).
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-5-
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-6-module MPY-OPERATORS
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-7-  imports MPY-CORE
